[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678093970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114249#issuecomment-3678093970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114249","id":3678093970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bO0KS","user":{"login":"giokhmaladze","id":7861548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE1NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7861548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze","html_url":"https://github.com/giokhmaladze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T20:32:59Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T20:33:57Z","body":"Confirmed: \r\n- Focus highlighting doesn't appear anymore when renaming using F2 key or right click -> rename.\r\n- This behaviour is consistent across FileSystem and Scene docks.\r\n\r\nOriginal issue is resolved but i stumbled upon new inconsistency between FileSystem & Scene docks while testing navigating with keyboard (it is present in 4.5.1 as well)\r\n\r\nOn Scene dock:\r\n- focus highlight/background (selection color) follows focus\r\n- while renaming tree entry input highlight and label highlight are on same line\r\n- right clicking on tree element doesn't hide highlight\r\n\r\nOn FileSystem dock:\r\n- focus highlight doesn't follow active element\r\n- while renaming active element highlight and input highlight are on different entries\r\n- right clicking on tree element (to rename) hides highlight\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if it's simple fix that can be resolved here or different issue, I'll leave it up to you, thanks!\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/623ff2ef-c0ef-434b-bc47-6920bee5333c\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678093970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678137229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114249#issuecomment-3678137229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114249","id":3678137229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bO-uN","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T21:34:19Z","updated_at":"2025-12-30T16:07:32Z","body":"I've fixed the right-click focus issue, the others ones aren't really a bug, but a quirk on how they handle selection:\r\n- Scene tree will always select where the cursor lands. This is why the inspector updates the moment you switch to another node.\r\n- FileSystem does not do that, which is why the Import dock doesn't change while you switch between files.\r\n\r\nOne could argue that the FileSystem dock should follow the same behavior, but that is out of the scope of this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678137229/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719836275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114249#issuecomment-3719836275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114249","id":3719836275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7duDJz","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"create